iv><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Character Thirst, Oxygen, Temperature, Health Mechanics </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Base Building </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Crafting </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Mining ores </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Build machines to create atmospheric pressure </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Build machines to heat the planet </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Create a biosphere with oxygen </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Create life on a planet !</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830840/extras/061057b74653a3bea13a28f7190006fc.poster.avif?t=1730825572\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830840/extras/061057b74653a3bea13a28f7190006fc.webm?t=1730825572\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1830840/extras/061057b74653a3bea13a28f7190006fc.mp4?t=1730825572\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
